            <p>
              Coastal Beach Retreats is proud to present <strong>Fanta Sea</strong>, a beautifully updated
              <strong>1-bedroom, 2-bath with bunk nook condo</strong> located in the highly sought-after
              <strong>Waterscape Resort on Okaloosa Island</strong>. Designed for comfort and relaxation,
              this inviting retreat offers peaceful pool views, resort-style amenities, and easy access to one
              of the most family-friendly beaches on the Emerald Coast.
            </p>

            <p><strong>🛌 Comfortable &amp; thoughtfully designed for families</strong></p>
            <p>
              Fanta Sea comfortably accommodates up to 6 guests (per HOA guidelines). The layout includes a
              king primary suite with private ensuite bath, balcony access, and flat-screen TV. A twin-over-twin
              bunk alcove is perfect for kids, and each bunk bed features its own TV at the base, giving
              everyone their own cozy space to relax and unwind. A sleeper sofa in the living area provides
              additional sleeping space, and a second full bathroom adds extra convenience.
            </p>
            <p>
              The open living space is ideal for unwinding after a day in the sun, while the private balcony
              offers a relaxing spot for morning coffee or evening cocktails with serene pool views.
            </p>

            <p><strong>🍽️ Fully equipped for easy vacation living</strong></p>
            <p>
              The fully stocked kitchen features stainless steel appliances and granite countertops, making
              vacation meals easy to prepare. A cozy dining area is perfect for gathering and planning your next
              adventure. An in-unit washer and dryer ensure a stress-free stay from start to finish.
            </p>

            <p><strong>🌴 Waterscape Resort – a destination in itself</strong></p>
            <p>
              Waterscape feels like a Caribbean-style oasis with amenities for all ages. Guests enjoy four resort
              pools, including a lazy river, a zero-entry pool with waterfalls, and a toddler splash area.
              Additional amenities include two hot tubs, a seasonal poolside tiki bar, a fitness center with pool
              views, poolside grills, a kids’ game room with organized activities, weekly poolside movie nights,
              secured covered parking, and 24-hour onsite security.
            </p>

            <p><strong>🏖️ Complimentary beach gear for your stay</strong></p>
            <p>
              To make your beach days effortless, we provide 6 beach towels, 6 beach chairs, a shoulder-strap
              cooler, a beach umbrella, and a beach wagon to easily transport everything to and from the beach.
              The wagon is especially helpful for the short walk along the resort’s boardwalk, making it simple
              to carry chairs, towels, and coolers without the hassle. Everything is provided so you can relax
              and enjoy the beautiful Emerald Coast without packing extra supplies.
            </p>

            <p><strong>📍 Prime Okaloosa Island location</strong></p>
            <p>
              Fanta Sea offers the best of both worlds, a laid-back island atmosphere just 10 minutes from
              Destin’s dining, shopping, and nightlife. Nearby attractions include the Okaloosa Island Fishing
              Pier, The Boardwalk with restaurants and shops, the Gulfarium Marine Adventure Park, and popular
              beachside dining such as Old Bay Steamer and AJ’s Oyster Shanty. You can even stroll down the beach
              to many local attractions.
            </p>

            <p><strong>❄️ Snowbirds welcome</strong></p>
            <p>
              Discounted monthly winter rates are available November through February. Monthly stays require
              arrival on the 1st and departure on the 1st of a subsequent month. An additional $150 cleaning fee
              applies.
            </p>

            <p><strong>ℹ️ Important guest information</strong></p>
            <p>
              The primary renter must be at least 25 years old, sign a rental agreement within 48 hours of
              booking, and be present for the duration of the stay. A $200 damage hold is required on a debit or
              credit card in the renter’s name. Smoking, pets, and parties are not permitted.
            </p>
